    "file_name": "XIN_ENG_20061124.0147.tml",
    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061124.0147\n\nKUNMING, Nov. 24 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nSW China traffic accident leaves six dead, one injured\n\n\n\n\nSix people were killed and one was injured in a traffic accident happening on Friday afternoon in the county of Songming, Southwest China's Yunnan Province.\n\nThe local police source said the tragedy occurred at about 2:40 p.m. in the county's Adalong village when a heavy-duty truck loaded with coal collided with a mini bus.\n\nSix people on the bus, including a two-year-old boy, were killed on the spot and the injured has already been hospitalized, said the police.\n\nInvestigation into the cause of the accident is already underway.",
